     rebuild on the computer with the data, from the vignettes/ folder:
     knitr::knit("animated_maps.Rmd.orig", "animated_maps.Rmd")
     The gifs (vignettes/figures/anim-*.gif) are shared with the Spanish
     version; they are made only if they do not exist (delete them to update).
